WEBVTT

00:23:59.954 --> 00:24:05.413
it's not only that you suffer now, but
that you will also continue to suffer,

00:24:05.579 --> 00:24:07.746
at least financially, for
a long time to come.

00:24:08.246 --> 00:24:09.746
But it isn't all bad news.

00:24:10.079 --> 00:24:13.788
As Emily looked around her in 2009,
she saw a strange pattern.

00:24:13.913 --> 00:24:17.329
One thing that really struck me was that
so many people were expressing gratitude.

00:24:18.038 --> 00:24:20.954
These people had just been dealt
this really tough hand.

00:24:21.621 --> 00:24:26.204
And yet again and again, I
kept hearing people say,

00:24:26.579 --> 00:24:29.413
I'm so grateful I got this job.
It's not what I hoped for.

00:24:29.913 --> 00:24:32.246
But, you know, it's a place to start.